  "editorial_title": "MARKET COMMENTARY:",
  "nutshell": [
    "- About 3% of the orderbook is scheduled for delivery as late",
    "- as 2028 or even the first few months of 2030 . (page 1)",
    "- Orderbook-to-fleet ratio for BC, TN, & GAS has grown by",
    "- 43%, 72%, and 48% respectively since 2022. (page 1)",
    "- Active shipyards in the orderbook have increased by about",
    "- 18% since 2022. (page 1)",
    "- 28% of the Greeks in the orderbook have placed 72% of the",
    "- Greek orders. (page 1)",
    "- WTI near its highest levels in nearly two months. (page 8)"
